*_DEBUG.md
*_FIX.md
*_SOLUTION.md
SECURITY_AUDIT*.md
TESTING_*.md
*_INTEGRATION_SUMMARY.md
*_API_INFRASTRUCTURE.md
SONGSTATS_README.md
SOUNDCHARTS_README.md

# Log files and temporary artifacts
